# A longer example with most features: tongue automation that overrides the
# syllables in bar 2, a toot, a vocalised bar and circular breathing.
title:      Groove demo
instrument: Kizimkazi
tempo:      104
meter:      4/4
swing:      58%
voice:      C4

[rhythm]
| !dong-ti dong-ti dong-tiki ritititi | doo _ di-ga ^         |
| !ta-ka ta-ka *too doo               | ~oo _ _ dong-ti       |

[tongue]
| auto                                | oo ~ ee .             |
| auto                                | auto                  |
